    2. Fit model_y on X[train] → Y[train] 
    3. Fit model_d on X[train] → D[train]
    4. Get residuals on X[test]
    5. OLS: ate = mean(Y_resid * D_resid) / mean(D_resid²)
    """
    kf = KFold(n_splits=___, shuffle=True, random_state=42)
